@startuml sequence-live-call
' SaqBol — live call analysis over WebSocket
title SaqBol — Live call transcript path (UC-7; main 91862dc)
autonumber

actor "Mobile user" as U
participant "Flutter app\n(speech_to_text)" as App
participant "OS speech service\nrequested locale: ru_RU" as STT
participant "Go backend\n/ws/call" as WS
participant "ML service\n(gRPC Classify)" as ML
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

U -> App : start analysis, put call on speakerphone
App -> WS : open WebSocket (?token=JWT)
note over App, STT
  Kazakh STT is not configured.
  Local-only audio processing is not enforced.
  Real-call recognition and latency need device tests.
end note
loop while the call lasts
  App -> STT : request microphone recognition
  STT --> App : final recognised text fragment
  App -> WS : {"text": fragment}
  WS -> WS : append to transcript,\ntake last 600 characters (sliding window)
  WS -> ML : Classify(window, channel="call")
  ML --> WS : probability, category, triggers
  WS --> App : {verdict, probability, category,\ntriggers, advice, alert}
  alt probability >= SCAM_THRESHOLD (0.8)
    App --> U : inline alert: "Possible fraud — do not dictate\ncodes or transfer money" (Russian text)
  end
end
U -> App : stop
App -> WS : close
WS -> DB : save call_session\n(transcript, max probability, alert flag)
note over WS, DB
  Current history reads messages, not call_sessions.
end note
@enduml
